      "id": "claim_404b863702584e2184a84a56193a961a",
      "statement": "TestTmall is a Spring-context test rather than a unit test: @RunWith(SpringJUnit4ClassRunner.class) with @ContextConfiguration(\"classpath:applicationContext.xml\"), an @Autowired DAOImpl field, and exactly two @Test methods both annotated @Transactional that drive the HibernateTemplate directly and import no assertion type, so a pass means only that the context refreshed and the statements did not throw.",
      "evidence": [
